  «text (-1700,-1900) 1 7 1 0x1000000 -1 -1 "ï»¿This example demonstrates .stepping a global parameter, R, while computing\nthe noise at a single frequency.  The resultant plot of V(inoise_density) vs. R\nshows a minimun noise with a tail resistance around 16kOhms."»
